    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0038",
      "reading_order": 495,
      "section": "The buttons and what they do",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.64222784188553,
        "t": 369.0266443577596,
        "r": 558.7147157578221,
        "b": 149.48814039443175
      },
      "markdown": "| Button Meaning                   | Function                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n|----------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Recipe creation Development Mode | 'Recipe creation' enables multistage cooking profiles to be developed, then stored under a name and icon for reuse.                                                                      |\n| Cookbook                         | 'Cookbook' contains the cooking profiles stored in the memory of the appliance. It displays favourites, cooking profile groups and a complete listing of all cooking profiles available. |\n| Press&Go                         | 'Press&Go' allows quick access to use the cooking profiles that are already stored.                                                                                                      |\n| Preheat                          | 'Preheat' is used to control the appliance operating temperature, upto six preheats can be stored on the appliance.                                                                      |\n| Settings                         | 'Settings' is used to control the appliance settings and functions including time and language, loading cooking profiles and for service and maintenance purposes.                       |\n| Cleaning                         | 'Cleaning ' allows the appliance to be prepared for cleaning with fully guided and customisable assistance during the cleaning process.                                                  |",
      "rows": 7,
      "cols": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_488",
